/-!
# Actual character shears and the positive-circle Wang summand

The literal shear `(c, x) ↦ (c - χ x, x)` fixes the genuine positive-circle
cross product with every degree-one or degree-two singular-homology class
of the four-torus. Both the product-circle model and the original real
lattice quotient are covered. The proof uses native maps, positive-loop
normalization, Pontryagin naturality and alternation, and the proved
generation of degree-two homology by actual coordinate-loop products.
-/
